    "author": "CDA Certified Provider • Sunny Skies",
    "content": "<p class=\"lead text-lg text-brand-slate font-medium leading-relaxed mb-6\">How medical-grade toy sanitization, strict handwashing rhymes, and separate cot linens keep seasonal colds and sniffles to an absolute minimum.</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold font-heading text-brand-navy mt-8 mb-4\">Daily 3-Tier Sanitization Standards</h2>\n<p class=\"mb-4 text-brand-slate leading-relaxed\">Developing immune systems require a vigilant defense against common colds. We implement medical-grade cleaning protocols across all surfaces, toys, and linens.</p>\n<div class=\"bg-[#ECF5FB] border-l-4 border-[#00BDE0] p-5 rounded-r-2xl my-6 text-brand-navy\">\n  <h4 class=\"font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-wider text-[#0A3366] mb-1\">Provider Pro-Tip</h4>\n  <p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed\">Any toy that an infant or toddler mouths is immediately placed in our sanitized 'catch bin' and washed with EPA-registered solutions before return.</p>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold font-heading text-brand-navy mt-8 mb-4\">High-Touch Surface Disinfection</h2>\n<p class=\"mb-4 text-brand-slate leading-relaxed\">Doorknobs, handrails, diaper changing tables, and sink faucets are sanitized multiple times throughout the day, following each meal and outdoor session.</p>\n<ul class=\"list-disc list-inside space-y-1.5 text-sm my-4 text-brand-slate\">\n  <li>Individualized rest cots and freshly laundered sheets.</li>\n  <li>20-second handwashing rhymes taught before every meal.</li>\n  <li>Air purification and open-window fresh air ventilation.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold font-heading text-brand-navy mt-8 mb-4\">Clear Illness & Fever Policies</h2>\n<p class=\"mb-4 text-brand-slate leading-relaxed\">Strict 24-hour fever-free and symptom-free return policies protect all families, keeping illness transmission rates remarkably low.</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold font-heading text-brand-navy mt-8 mb-4\">Tour Sunny Skies Daycare in Lorton, VA</h2>\n<p class=\"mb-4 text-brand-slate leading-relaxed\">Experience our warm, accredited home daycare environment for yourself. We invite you to <a href=\"/appointment\" class=\"text-[#00BDE0] hover:underline font-semibold\">schedule an in-person tour</a>, explore our <a href=\"/services\" class=\"text-[#00BDE0] hover:underline font-semibold\">programs for ages Newborn to 15 Years</a>, or call us at <a href=\"tel:+17036061557\" class=\"text-[#00BDE0] hover:underline font-semibold\">+1 (703) 606-1557</a>.</p>"
